  "research_boundary": "The four added classes are operational proxies over the existing 4x4 bridge paths. Metathesis is a local transposition model; acrophonic compression approximates retaining initial states from hypothesized chunks because the current proto-word dataset has no phrase boundaries; clipping/blending removes medial material or keeps word edges; resegmentation is approximated by boundary rotations. A positive result would show predictive structure under these operators, not prove a particular prehistoric derivation, Proto-World, or deliberate language engineering.",
